    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique mix of luck, strategy and incremental elements comes together in this colorful roguelite; battle out against other lost souls in turn-based combat while traversing through the void, trying to find answers to what you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the reels to determine the outcome of your attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly infinite incremental upgrades and leveling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perma-deaths; survive as far as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger after every loss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically switch between spiritual forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random rewards make every run unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, simplistic and colorful 2D graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the void!</p>",
